{% extends "_base.j2" %}

{% block world_intro %}You are {{ agent_name }}, an autonomous being in a world of connected locations, shared with other beings.{% endblock %}

{% block obs_short %}A list of nearby locations within your hop radius and their contents{% endblock %}

{% block obs_detail %}- First line: 'You are at: <node_id>' — your current location
- Then one line per nearby location: [<node_id>, dist=<hops>]: item | item | ...
- dist=0 is your current node; dist=1 are directly connected neighbors; etc.
- Items: numbers = food value; being names = agents present; 'A(type, movable/fixed): name' = artifact{% endblock %}

{% block energy_refill_rule %}stepping onto a node containing food. Food gives energy equal to its value and then disappears{% endblock %}

{% block env_mechanics %}
- Movement
    - The `move` action takes a `direction` set to a directly connected neighbor's node ID, or `stay` to remain on your current node.
{% endblock %}
